ed the invading German forces in May 1940 at the Somme. After the Battle of France the 1st Foreign Regiment was on garrison duty in Tunisia, but in 1943 it was refitted with US weapons and armor and joined the Free French Foreign Legionnaires as part of the 5th Armored Division. The regiment engaged Axis forces in Tunisia in 1943 and in 1944 it landed in France and participated in the Liberation of France.","LocalizedString":"The 1st Foreign Regiment was first formed in 1841 and it still exists although it only performs administrative duties today. In 1940 the regiment was sent to France and engaged the invading German forces in May 1940 at the Somme. After the Battle of France the 1st Foreign Regiment was on garrison duty in Tunisia, but in 1943 it was refitted with US weapons and armor and joined the Free French Foreign Legionnaires as part of the 5th Armored Division. The regiment engaged Axis forces in Tunisia in 1943 and in 1944 it landed in France and participated in the Liberation of France."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Campaign2020","isInPermanentPool":true,"chooseOneCards":[{"cardText":{"Namespace":"","Key":"7702C44A4583C2F369575D83471F04F3","SourceString":"Gain Blitz and draw a card.","LocalizedString":"Gain Blitz and draw a card."},"selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":false},{"cardText":{"Namespace":"","Key":"3E71351C4DAE5D85582DA0AB4E90AE4C","SourceString":"Gain Guard and your HQ gets +4 defense.","LocalizedString":"Gain Guard and your HQ gets +4 defense."},"selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":false}],"hasDeployment":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion_Small'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/Explosion_Small.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/France/t_foreign_legion.t_foreign_legion","SubPathString":""},"ImageAnchor":"EImageAnchor::Bot","artist":"Lordprice Collection / Alamy Stock Photo","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/1er_R